# Clean-pose ground-truth trials measured +0.928 deg drift at I=0.004 and
# -0.847 deg at I=0.006 over ~23 simulated seconds.  Interpolated zero-bias
# value is 0.00505.  Final I=0.005 validation reduced absolute drift to
# 0.444 deg and yaw standard deviation from 0.459 deg to 0.327 deg.
ATC_RAT_YAW_I   0.0050

# Intermediate CMA-ES incumbent retained after 35 completed overnight
# generations on 2026-09-10. This profile is intentionally checkpointed for
# live evaluation; it has not yet passed every final stress gate.
